Author: Beacon <info@lucernaread.com>
Date:   Wed Nov 11 09:39:49 2026 +0000

    tools: webpdf weight + italic face resolution (ru-en D3)
    
    fc-match now uses :weight=200/:weight=100 (CairoSVG weights) instead of
    :style=Bold, and :slant=italic as an orthogonal axis, so each family
    subsets up to four faces (Regular/Bold/Italic/Bold Italic). U+0020 is
    guaranteed in every subset charset. Fixes ru-en proof2 D3: web PDF lost
    the italic WORD OF THE WEEK face (space glyph, detached closing quote,
    upright glyphs where print uses NotoSerif-MediumItalic +
    Newsreader-Italic). Verified by ru-en proof3 (a). Print PDFs untouched.

